@startuml
!include ../../_theme.puml
title Dependency Check
top to bottom direction

package "Dependency Sources" {
  rectangle "Constraint Collection" as Constraints
  rectangle "Workshop Dependency Resolution" as Workshop
  rectangle "Vapor Dependency Resolution" as Vapor
}

rectangle "Fingerprint Check" as Fingerprints
rectangle "Compatible Graph" as Graph
rectangle "Missing Dependency Rejection" as Reject

Constraints --> Workshop : provides Steam constraints to
Constraints --> Vapor : provides Vapor constraints to
Workshop --> Fingerprints : supplies item revisions to
Vapor --> Fingerprints : supplies expected hashes to
Fingerprints --> Graph : admits matching deps to
Workshop --> Reject : reports missing item to
Vapor --> Reject : reports missing dep to
Fingerprints --> Reject : reports hash mismatch to
@enduml
